1. Encouraging carpooling and public transportation usage, reducing individual vehicle use to decrease traffic flow; 
2. Building more high-capacity bus lines and improving urban road networks, ensuring that pedestrians and vehicles can move freely within city limits while also facilitating the smooth operation of public transportation; 
3. Promoting telecommuting to reduce the need for daily travel, making it easier for people to manage work-life balance.
